# Sheets and scratch renders must never be committed: only the six cropped
# icons, each under its service slug. tools/crop_icon_sheet.py deletes the
# sheet itself, and this is the second line of defence for anything that slips
# past it (a half-finished sheet, a test render, an ImageMagick temp file).
_*.png
_*.jpg
_*.webp
*.tmp
*.mvg
